#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/features/diary.md:1 docs/features/diary.md:5 messages/po4a/en.xml:716
#, no-wrap
msgid "Diary"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:8
msgid ""
"Structured diary for users and Agents, based on the [Unified Entity Model]"
"(../concepts/entity-model.md) `diary_entry` **container** plus child "
"`content_block` (text) bricks."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "vs memory system"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Capability | Diary                                              | Memory bricks (limbic / narrative / dream)                               |\n"
"| ---------- | -------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| Source     | User / Agent **writes actively**                   | Sleep pipeline / memory tools                                            |\n"
"| Storage    | `entities` + `diary_entry` + child `content_block` | Same diary containers + semantic tags (`limbic` / `narrative` / `dream`) |\n"
"| Editing    | Plain text blocks updateable                       | Semantic bricks append-only / soft-deprecate                             |\n"
"| Namespace  | subject **default private world**                  | Agent private world for sleep-written bricks                             |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:19
msgid ""
"Diary UI labels semantic bricks（梦境 / 情绪 / 自传）as read-only sections "
"in the day entry."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid "User / Agent isolation"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:25
msgid ""
"User and Agent diaries live in the **default private world** of subjects "
"resolved from `config.yaml` **`worlds.user_subject_id` / "
"`agent_subject_id`** (boot-time `ResolvedWorldContext`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:25
msgid ""
"Shell header **User / Agent** toggle selects which subject's diary to view "
"(see [`entity-model.md`](../concepts/entity-model.md) global Subject scope)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:25
msgid ""
"LLM tools (ToolSet `diary`) default to the **caller subject's private "
"world** (conversation LLM → agent world); optional **`world_id`** overrides "
"(e.g. `user_world_id` from system prompt)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "Data shape"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:29
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Container** (`diary_entry`):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:34
msgid ""
"`body.entry_at` — ISO 8601, when the diary entry occurred (**unique per "
"day** per subject private world)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:34
msgid ""
"`tag_ids` — optional tags（顶层 `entities.tag_ids`，指向同 World 的 `tag` "
"entity）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:34
msgid "`title` / `summary` — entity columns"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:34
msgid ""
"container **`content` is not used for body text** (kept empty after "
"migration)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Blocks** (`content_block`, `block_type: text`):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
msgid "`body.parent_id` → diary entry id"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
msgid "`body.sort_order` — view order (no semantic precedence)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
msgid "text lives in the block's `content` column"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
msgid ""
"optional `title` (entity column) — user-editable block heading; empty means "
"no heading weight in UI"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
msgid ""
"optional `tag_ids` (entity column) — unified entity tags（与日记容器同一模"
"型）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:43
msgid ""
"semantic component tags on the block (`dream` / `limbic` / `narrative`) "
"render as read-only labels（梦境 / 情绪 / 自传）beside the title; they are "
"**not** the block title"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "**日记块模板** (`diary_block_template` entity, subject private world):\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:51
msgid "`entities.title` = **模板名称**（列表/管理显示）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:51
msgid ""
"`entities.content` / `entities.tag_ids` stay empty — do **not** store insert "
"payload there"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:51
msgid ""
"`body.preset` = `{ title, content, components, tag_ids }` applied when "
"inserting a new text block"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:51
msgid ""
"SAP: `diary.templateList` / `templateCreate` / `templatePatch` / "
"`templateDelete`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:51
msgid "Empty world lazy-seeds「今日回顾」「运动」"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:53
msgid ""
"UI also persists per-block expand/collapse in localStorage (default "
"expanded)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:55
msgid ""
"One-shot migration: Habitat `runMigrations` moves legacy diary `content` "
"into the first text block and clears the container column."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "Agent tools (ToolSet `diary`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:59
msgid ""
"Load via `toolset_load` with `diary`. Tools locate entries by **`date` (YYYY-"
"MM-DD)**；**default today** (CST noon `…T12:00:00+08:00`)；**no "
"`diary_create`** — use `diary_append` (creates empty shell for the day if "
"missing, then adds a **new text block**). All tools accept optional "
"**`world_id`**."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool           | Description                                                                               |\n"
"| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| `diary_append` | New text block for date; create shell if missing; `tags`/`tag_ids` only on shell creation |\n"
"| `diary_update` | Update entry **metadata** (title/summary/`tags`/`tag_ids`) by date — not body text        |\n"
"| `diary_get`    | Read entry + `blocks` for date; error if not found                                        |\n"
"| `diary_delete` | Delete entry for date (cascades child blocks); returns `{ ok, action, date }`             |\n"
"| `diary_list`   | List by `entry_at DESC` (default `limit=20`, `offset`); optional date/`tags`/`tag_ids`    |\n"
"| `diary_search` | Hybrid search over **text blocks**, returns matching diary entries                        |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:70
msgid "Fine-grained block CRUD / reorder: ToolSet `content-block`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "**vs SAP/UI**: Shell `/diary` uses SAP `diary.*` / `diary.block*` located by entity **`id`**; Agent ToolSet uses **`date`** uniformly.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/features/diary.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "SAP methods"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:76
msgid "UI satellite `@freeanima/satellite-diary` (`/diary`) calls SAP:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:80
msgid ""
"`diary.list` / `diary.create` / `diary.append` / `diary.patch` / "
"`diary.delete` / `diary.get` / `diary.search`"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:80
msgid ""
"`diary.blockCreate` / `diary.blockPatch` / `diary.blockDelete` / "
"`diary.blockReorder` (text only; create/patch accept optional `title` / "
"`tag_ids` / `components`)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:80
msgid ""
"`diary.templateList` / `diary.templateCreate` / `diary.templatePatch` / "
"`diary.templateDelete`（日记块模板；`name` ≠ `preset`）"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/features/diary.md:82
msgid "All methods require `subject_kind: user | agent`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:88
msgid ""
"`diary.list` defaults to **`entry_at DESC`**, `limit=20`, supports `offset` "
"pagination"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:88
msgid ""
"`diary.create` optional `content` → first text block (container `content` "
"stays empty)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:88
msgid "`diary.append` → new trailing text block"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:88
msgid "`diary.patch` → container metadata only"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:88
msgid "`diary.delete` → cascade-delete child blocks"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/features/diary.md:88
msgid ""
"`diary.template*` → CRUD for `diary_block_template`（模板名 `name` + 插入载"
"荷 `preset`）"
msgstr ""
